      <div type="clause" n="7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be freolsdæges weorcum.] [Ld] Sunnandægas cypinge gif hwa agynne, þolie þæs ceapes ⁊ twelf orena mid Denum ⁊ XXX scll' mid Englum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone proceeds to bargain on a Sunday, he shall forfeit the goods, and 12 ores [in addition] in a Danish district, and 30 shillings in an English district.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Sunnandægas cypinge gyf hwá agynne, ðolie ðæs ceapes ⁊ XII ore mid Denum ⁊ XXX scill' mid Englum.</ab>
      </div>
